  "description": "Core-recorded Agent Runtime occupancy estimates on lat3/lat4, gated by the age of the app-plane export. Not an admission-capacity signal.",
  "editable": true,
  "fiscalYearStartMonth": 0,
  "graphTooltip": 0,
  "id": null,
  "links": [],
  "liveNow": false,
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "How to read these estimates",
      "description": "Core-recorded occupancy is not the Runner admission decision.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 18,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Unused slots are estimates, not admission capacity.** 42 minus Core-recorded active Runtimes. Runtimes with incomplete artifact identity are excluded. Runner drain, reservations and host readiness are not measured; check `scripts/finite-status` before capacity decisions.\n\nCore exports every 5 minutes. Missing, future-dated or at least 10-minute-old exports hide counts. **Unknown / No data** can also mean no counted Runtimes; it never means 42 available slots. The 42-slot ceiling is pinned configuration, not a live metric."
      },
      "pluginVersion": "13.0.2"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "finite-prometheus"
      },
      "description": "Age of the last successful Core export on finite-lat-2. Collection runs every 5 minutes. At 10 minutes, or for a future-dated or missing file, occupancy estimates are hidden.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "decimals": 0,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 0
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 300
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 600
              }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "s",
          "noValue": "Unknown"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 18,
        "y": 0
      },
      "id": 8,
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "last"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "name_and_value",
        "wideLayout": true
      },
      "pluginVersion": "13.0.2",
      "targets": [
        {
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "time() - max(node_textfile_mtime_seconds{instance=\"finite-lat-2\",job=\"finite-internal-health\",file=\"/run/finite-monitoring/finite-runtime.prom\"})",
          "instant": true,
          "legendFormat": "__auto",
          "range": false,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Core Sample Age",
      "type": "stat"
    },
